                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "When Medicare payments don\u2019t keep up with the cost of care, providers leave and patients lose access. My bipartisan bill would stop these cuts, stabilize reimbursements, and ensure seniors in SLO County, CA-19, and across the country can get the care they earned. \nhttps://t.co/SDORixvNbQ",
