                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Medicare reimbursements have dropped 33% since 2001, while costs have soared. That\u2019s unsustainable for providers and patients on the Central Coast. At Cuesta College, I joined @RepCarbajal & local health leaders to push solutions that protect seniors\u2019 care and support providers. \nhttps://t.co/1mJp8AVY7J",
