                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Families are already struggling with the high cost of health care, and the Administration\u2019s proposed drug tariffs would drive premiums even higher. We should be lowering costs, protecting coverage, and building a system where every American can afford the care they need. That is why Congress must reclaim its Constitutional control over trade.\nhttps://t.co/QrmIkCsxCg",
