                "text": "The Administration\u2019s cuts to Medicaid are forcing states into a chaotic competition just to keep rural hospitals open. That\u2019s wrong. Patients deserve stable, fair support they can count on, and that\u2019s what I\u2019m fighting for. \nhttps://t.co/Jmljl0gH2w",
