                "text": "Families are already feeling the squeeze of higher costs. Now this Administration and this Majority have cut health care and put millions at risk of losing coverage. I will keep fighting to restore ACA subsidies and lower costs so every American can access affordable care.\nhttps://t.co/2uvk8bIu2x",
