                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "At my 22nd town hall, we talked about what matters most: protecting access to care, funding cancer research, and following science. I\u2019ll keep working to ensure vaccine recommendations are based on evidence, not politics, and to protect Medi-Cal patients. https://t.co/rNyqvP2KLA",
