                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Patients shouldn\u2019t waste hours chasing \u201cghost\u201d providers only to face higher bills or go without care. I reintroduced the bipartisan REAL Health Providers Act to ensure Medicare Advantage plans keep provider directories accurate so seniors get the appropriate care. \nhttps://t.co/SjDtf4rUzd",
