                "retweet_count": 18,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Instead of working to keep the government open, Speaker Johnson is risking people\u2019s health care. If ACA tax credits lapse, providers lose $32B, families in CA-19 face 75% premium hikes, and 28,500 of our neighbors in CA-19 lose coverage. I\u2019m fighting to protect health care & lower costs.\n\nhttps://t.co/r4QMixBVZX",
