                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Today, we are in DC to highlight the need to reopen the government and protect our healthcare.  I was proud to stand with parents, caretakers, and patients who told their stories about how cuts to healthcare will impact them. https://t.co/Ks5TavllzV",
