                "text": "The U.S. must clarify and support Ukraine using long-range strikes to target Russian military assets. In the meantime, Putin continues to attack kindergarten schools in Kharkiv, hospitals in Kyiv, and energy infrastructure throughout the country. I led my colleagues in the House and Senate to call on President Trump to immediately lift these restrictions and allow Ukraine to strike military assets that are supplying Russian troops and killing innocent Ukrainians.",
