                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "The cost of healthcare has skyrocketed in CA-19 and across the country. I joined my colleagues in supporting a bipartisan framework which aims to lower healthcare costs and protect access to affordable coverage for working families. I urge the House and Senate leadership to bring this vital measure to vote in the coming weeks so we can tackle this affordability crisis.\u00a0\n\nhttps://t.co/GxeZeAqMIu",
