                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "We must extend the tax credits for those who rely on the Affordable Care Act, including the 40,000 people in the 19th Congressional District.\u00a0If not, their health care premiums could increase on average to over $20k per year.\u00a0After bipartisan support, Speaker Johnson is now forced to put the bill up for a vote that extends those tax credits for three years.\u00a0It\u2019s unfortunate that we govern by discharge petition rather than by leadership, but I will do what\u2019s necessary to reduce costs for working families.",
